# Binary test fixtures committed in this skill — bypass git's text processing
# (skip CRLF/LF conversion, text diff, text merge).
#
# Only covers fixtures that are *committed* to the repo. Runtime artifacts
# (e.g. ffmpeg-generated MPEG-TS slices) are handled by .gitignore instead —
# different concern, different file.
#
# Path-scoped: limit binary marking to test asset directories only, so future
# source files elsewhere stay text-mode.

scripts/test_videos/*.mp4      binary
scripts/test_images/**/*.jpg   binary
scripts/test_images/**/*.jpeg  binary
